  "duration_s": 587.425,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你相信吗？中国最能挣钱的人不在上海，不在深圳。中国最牛的投资机构是合肥市政府。曾经没人看得上他，偏偏他最争气，你敢相信吗？一觉醒来，合肥凭空多了一点二万亿朱军，你知道这一点二万亿是个什么概念吗？相当于广州市小半年的GDP总和全国近三成的土地财政收入。过去是江浙沪皖，现在是皖，江浙沪安徽省的名字是由安庆和徽州组。原本安徽的省会是在安庆长江五湖之一，却因为战争导致城市严重受损，最后选择在了小县城。合肥。它既不临江，也不靠海，甚至并不算交通枢纽，总人口只有五六万，连隔壁的凤阳、小岗村都比它还要出名。论金融资本比不过上海，论民营经济，拼不过杭州，论外贸制造干不过无锡，论教育，科研拼不过南京，二十年前曾被人嘲笑，是中国最大的县城省会。如果不是一手，我歌泸州月，我都不知道合肥原来叫泸州，甚至很多人一直以为安徽的省会是南京憋屈的合肥十年寒窗一战成名。就在长兴敲钟的那一周，韩国股市连跌五天，美国的科技股一周跌了将近百分之八。这一个项目的回报，顶了合肥一整年的GDP,合肥改命最厉害的东西叫长期主义。二零零八年，全球金融危机爆发，京东方走投无路，合肥拿出全市三分之一的财政收入砸进京，东方做液晶面板，二零二零年未来资金链断裂，濒临倒闭。合肥雪中送炭，投了一百亿救命钱，拉了未来一把。刚投资完整个新能源，汽车行业开始起飞。现在，合肥的新能源汽车产量占全国第一，二零一六年，全球存储芯片的百分之九十六的市场被美韩三大巨头垄断。中国自主产能几乎为零，长兴要搞芯片，合肥掏出了全市财政收入的四分之一。长兴成立的前六年累计亏掉三百六十六亿，但合肥无怨无悔，陪跑了整整十年。合肥奇迹的真相是后代，读书人的城市永远不会输。合肥真正押重的并不只是几家公司，而是知识产业和时间，它最难复制的也不是投钱，而是前人栽树，后人不拔树继续浇水。合肥真正的逆袭之路得从一所大学开始。一九六九年，中国科学技术大学从北京外迁，当时河南、江西、湖北都说养不起，只有安徽合肥砸锅卖铁把中科大接回了家。一九七零年，中科大正式迁入合肥，搬来了三万五千多箱的仪器和图书和六千多名师生。合肥没有暖气，却为北方来的师生们铺设了全市第一条供暖线。合肥最穷的时候，市政府可以停电，但中科大绝不能停电。全城所有的粮食优先给到中科大，每人每天省下一口粮，也一定要让中科大的师生吃饱。在那个物质极度匮乏的年代，一座又小又穷的城市，倾其所有，把一所流浪的大学揽入怀中，这是一座城市对于知识最大的敬意。半个多世纪过去了，这颗当年被合肥小心翼翼种下的种子生根开花，成为合肥发展最坚实的人才。底座千生一愿是百人一结清，号称AI,黄埔军校撑起了人工智能国内的半边天。清华北大出天才，而中科大出神仙，火星探测天问一号深海探测东风导弹的背后，都有柯大人的影子。哪个丈母娘不希望找一个中科大的女婿？一个国家如果没有自己的存储芯片，就是把数字时代的饭碗端在别人手里。而长兴更给了全中国人以底气。如果没有安徽，就没有江浙沪的繁华，没有国泰民安的守护你，知道为什么安徽总是感觉很穷吗？是因为安徽的抗日要比其他省份提前了几十年。中国抗日战争从九一八开始，而安徽人的抗日从甲午战争就开始。一八九四年甲午海战，李鸿章的淮军撑起了北洋水师，舰上的兵将，几乎全是江淮子弟。安徽人一省战，一国与日寇展开殊死搏斗，最终全部牺牲。抗战期间，安徽打没了，整整一代人打到十室九空打到山穷水尽，最终无奈组建了中国第一支孤儿军，全国二点九万个历史陵园，安徽就占了二点二万。安徽之所以吃米，也吃面，十里不同音，百里不同俗。就是因为安徽人后来汇聚了五湖四海的兄弟，组成现在的安徽。如今的安徽又承担着泄洪使命，是全国泄洪区最多的省份。二零二一年的河南大水，郑州，一小时的降水量相当于一百五十个西湖。这洪水从郑州退去以后去哪儿了？大部分到了安徽，当时安徽自己有将近四百万人受灾，但是为了上保河南，下保江浙沪，安徽默默捂着自己的伤口。开闸泄洪王家坝的村民放弃了自己辛苦建起来的房子，放弃了种满粮食的土地，连夜转移。而这样的牺牲，安徽建国以来做了十多次，舍小家为大家，为饱城市自毁家乡，是安徽人扛下了所有滚滚逝去的洪水里藏着安徽人的泪水。总有人调侃，安徽很穷，遍地是乞丐。可是，诸君，中国四大商帮之一，鼎鼎有名的徽商怎么会穷，不过是把满腔热血献给了最爱的祖国？安徽人委屈，但安徽人从来不说中国。第一台蒸汽机、第一台卫星计算机、第一台电冰箱、第一艘电动船都在安徽诞生。安徽省高铁总里程全国第一，汽车整车出口量全国第一，液晶显示屏产量全国第一。冰箱、空调、洗衣机产量都是全国第一，而量子科技专利更是全球前二全国第一，全球百分之十的笔记本电脑都是安徽生产。更让人感动的是，好不容易富起来的合肥，也从来不吃独食，从不忘给兄弟们分一杯羹。它做新能源，整车芜湖搞传统车升级安庆，做车灯、六安做储能，宣城负责上游原材料马鞍山做电池，安徽十六个地市全部上出，没有一个掉队。诸晶合肥模式不能被简化，成地方政府都去压龙头。他背后是有中科大科学岛国家科学中心工程教育与既有制造业，也有专业国资平台和跨任期的连续性。如果没有技术判断和产业配套，只学大手笔投钱复制出来的可能不是合肥，而是债务。你看看合肥官方怎么说，我们不是风投，是铲投，不是赌博，是拼搏。更让人敬佩的是，合肥国资的胸怀与格局掏了几百亿，却是投而不控，不抢控制权，不插手经营，不往董事会塞人，这才是对专业主义精神的最大的尊重。这也就是为什么没有任何城市能够复制合肥模式。合肥真正押中的第一张王牌并不是某家公司，而是知识。他还为阅读这种慢事留下了空间。合肥被称为高阅读城市密集的建设城市阅读空间和十五分钟的阅读圈。一间公共书房并不能直接制造GDP,但他会告诉年轻人，这座城市愿意为一个人安静坐下来的时间买单，而这也是合肥模式最容易被人忽视的细节。网上喜欢说他出手果断，却很少说他为何判断得出。喜欢说他敢砸钱，却很少说知识、科研、工程、教育和产业调查才是钱不至于变成烟花的底层结构。合肥是真正靠读书改变命运。朱军这世上，哪有什么点石成金的风头神话。长兴上市的钟声，不过是时间给合肥的一封回信。那是五十六年前，合肥用砸锅卖铁的制成为军学者保留下来了一张温暖的书桌。那是厂房，机器二十四小时运转，一群穿着无尘服的人看不见风景，却在制造未来。五十六年之后，对知识的后代和技术的尊重，反哺了这座城市，而你以为这就是合肥的极限了吗？合肥的手里还握着一张震撼世界的终极王牌，可控核聚变。从东方超环屡破世界纪录，到跨府大科学装置，破译核心部件，再到人造太阳装置冲刺，点亮人类第一盏聚变之灯。全国百分之三十七的核聚变专利都在合肥，这里正在孕育属于全人类的能源未来。从当年毫无优势的中部城市，到如今一战封神的直逼全国第四城，合肥不追风口、不赚快钱、不炒概念，所年如一日，倾一城之力，托举属于中国的科技巨头企业，在熬城市也在熬熬过了周期低谷，熬过了技术封锁。终于迎来了万物复苏的收获期。所有的爆发都是折伏后的必然为合肥骄傲，为中国硬科技点赞。回望合肥这座城，你会发现他几乎一直在做合这件事儿。它让长江与淮河相合，让北方的刚劲与南方的细腻相合，让古老的泸州与现代科创相合，让一座大学与一座城相合。三国时代，合肥守住的是曹魏东南的一道门。而今天他打开的是中国硬科创未来的一扇门。所以驻军合肥到底肥在哪里？他不是肥在天生富足，而是肥在胆识，肥在耐心。一座城市最伟大的逆袭，不是终于被人看见，而是他当年在无人看见时，仍然愿意把钱、时间和信任交给明天。这座城市从来不信风口，它只信一件事，把种子埋进土里，浇十年水，等它自己长出来。而这才是真正的合肥。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00001",
      "start_ms": 640,
      "end_ms": 1340,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1500,
      "end_ms": 3680,
      "text": "中国最能挣钱的人不在上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3680,
      "end_ms": 4380,
      "text": "不在深圳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4740,
      "end_ms": 7860,
      "text": "中国最牛的投资机构是合肥市政府。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8460,
      "end_ms": 9820,
      "text": "曾经没人看得上他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9880,
      "end_ms": 11080,
      "text": "偏偏他最争气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11580,
      "end_ms": 12460,
      "text": "你敢相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12500,
      "end_ms": 13220,
      "text": "一觉醒来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13220,
      "end_ms": 16300,
      "text": "合肥凭空多了一点二万亿朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16500,
      "end_ms": 18860,
      "text": "你知道这一点二万亿是个什么概念吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00011",
      "start_ms": 18980,
      "end_ms": 23880,
      "text": "相当于广州市小半年的GDP总和全国近三成的土地财政收入。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24000,
      "end_ms": 25500,
      "text": "过去是江浙沪皖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25620,
      "end_ms": 26580,
      "text": "现在是皖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26780,
      "end_ms": 30295,
      "text": "江浙沪安徽省的名字是由安庆和徽州组。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30810,
      "end_ms": 34210,
      "text": "原本安徽的省会是在安庆长江五湖之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34290,
      "end_ms": 36550,
      "text": "却因为战争导致城市严重受损，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36690,
      "end_ms": 38150,
      "text": "最后选择在了小县城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00018",
      "start_ms": 38150,
      "end_ms": 38570,
      "text": "合肥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38830,
      "end_ms": 39770,
      "text": "它既不临江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39790,
      "end_ms": 40490,
      "text": "也不靠海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40610,
      "end_ms": 42350,
      "text": "甚至并不算交通枢纽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42770,
      "end_ms": 44150,
      "text": "总人口只有五六万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00023",
      "start_ms": 44330,
      "end_ms": 47130,
      "text": "连隔壁的凤阳、小岗村都比它还要出名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47350,
      "end_ms": 49050,
      "text": "论金融资本比不过上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49110,
      "end_ms": 50010,
      "text": "论民营经济，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50010,
      "end_ms": 50850,
      "text": "拼不过杭州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00027",
      "start_ms": 51050,
      "end_ms": 52750,
      "text": "论外贸制造干不过无锡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52870,
      "end_ms": 53550,
      "text": "论教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53550,
      "end_ms": 54910,
      "text": "科研拼不过南京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55290,
      "end_ms": 57070,
      "text": "二十年前曾被人嘲笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57070,
      "end_ms": 59230,
      "text": "是中国最大的县城省会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59570,
      "end_ms": 60400,
      "text": "如果不是一手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60460,
      "end_ms": 61340,
      "text": "我歌泸州月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61360,
      "end_ms": 63285,
      "text": "我都不知道合肥原来叫泸州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63730,
      "end_ms": 70495,
      "text": "甚至很多人一直以为安徽的省会是南京憋屈的合肥十年寒窗一战成名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00036",
      "start_ms": 70800,
      "end_ms": 72575,
      "text": "就在长兴敲钟的那一周，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00037",
      "start_ms": 72840,
      "end_ms": 74620,
      "text": "韩国股市连跌五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74960,
      "end_ms": 77305,
      "text": "美国的科技股一周跌了将近百分之八。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00039",
      "start_ms": 77800,
      "end_ms": 78880,
      "text": "这一个项目的回报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00040",
      "start_ms": 78880,
      "end_ms": 80495,
      "text": "顶了合肥一整年的GDP,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00041",
      "start_ms": 80910,
      "end_ms": 83715,
      "text": "合肥改命最厉害的东西叫长期主义。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00042",
      "start_ms": 84150,
      "end_ms": 84930,
      "text": "二零零八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00043",
      "start_ms": 85090,
      "end_ms": 86535,
      "text": "全球金融危机爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00044",
      "start_ms": 86790,
      "end_ms": 88010,
      "text": "京东方走投无路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00045",
      "start_ms": 88170,
      "end_ms": 91310,
      "text": "合肥拿出全市三分之一的财政收入砸进京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00046",
      "start_ms": 91310,
      "end_ms": 92535,
      "text": "东方做液晶面板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00047",
      "start_ms": 92830,
      "end_ms": 94965,
      "text": "二零二零年未来资金链断裂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00048",
      "start_ms": 95180,
      "end_ms": 95875,
      "text": "濒临倒闭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00049",
      "start_ms": 96150,
      "end_ms": 97310,
      "text": "合肥雪中送炭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00050",
      "start_ms": 97310,
      "end_ms": 98650,
      "text": "投了一百亿救命钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00051",
      "start_ms": 98650,
      "end_ms": 99555,
      "text": "拉了未来一把。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00052",
      "start_ms": 99790,
      "end_ms": 101470,
      "text": "刚投资完整个新能源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00053",
      "start_ms": 101470,
      "end_ms": 102985,
      "text": "汽车行业开始起飞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00054",
      "start_ms": 103370,
      "end_ms": 103770,
      "text": "现在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00055",
      "start_ms": 103770,
      "end_ms": 106205,
      "text": "合肥的新能源汽车产量占全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00056",
      "start_ms": 106560,
      "end_ms": 107260,
      "text": "二零一六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00057",
      "start_ms": 107400,
      "end_ms": 112155,
      "text": "全球存储芯片的百分之九十六的市场被美韩三大巨头垄断。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00058",
      "start_ms": 112460,
      "end_ms": 114265,
      "text": "中国自主产能几乎为零，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00059",
      "start_ms": 114520,
      "end_ms": 115565,
      "text": "长兴要搞芯片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00060",
      "start_ms": 115850,
      "end_ms": 118555,
      "text": "合肥掏出了全市财政收入的四分之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00061",
      "start_ms": 118900,
      "end_ms": 122215,
      "text": "长兴成立的前六年累计亏掉三百六十六亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00062",
      "start_ms": 122420,
      "end_ms": 124020,
      "text": "但合肥无怨无悔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00063",
      "start_ms": 124020,
      "end_ms": 125305,
      "text": "陪跑了整整十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00064",
      "start_ms": 125980,
      "end_ms": 128150,
      "text": "合肥奇迹的真相是后代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00065",
      "start_ms": 128170,
      "end_ms": 130335,
      "text": "读书人的城市永远不会输。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00066",
      "start_ms": 130690,
      "end_ms": 133150,
      "text": "合肥真正押重的并不只是几家公司，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00067",
      "start_ms": 133350,
      "end_ms": 135595,
      "text": "而是知识产业和时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00068",
      "start_ms": 135970,
      "end_ms": 137690,
      "text": "它最难复制的也不是投钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00069",
      "start_ms": 137950,
      "end_ms": 139390,
      "text": "而是前人栽树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00070",
      "start_ms": 139390,
      "end_ms": 141545,
      "text": "后人不拔树继续浇水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00071",
      "start_ms": 141900,
      "end_ms": 144845,
      "text": "合肥真正的逆袭之路得从一所大学开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00072",
      "start_ms": 145170,
      "end_ms": 145830,
      "text": "一九六九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00073",
      "start_ms": 145830,
      "end_ms": 147925,
      "text": "中国科学技术大学从北京外迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00074",
      "start_ms": 148200,
      "end_ms": 150515,
      "text": "当时河南、江西、湖北都说养不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00075",
      "start_ms": 150820,
      "end_ms": 154355,
      "text": "只有安徽合肥砸锅卖铁把中科大接回了家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00076",
      "start_ms": 155070,
      "end_ms": 155870,
      "text": "一九七零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00077",
      "start_ms": 155870,
      "end_ms": 157575,
      "text": "中科大正式迁入合肥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00078",
      "start_ms": 157850,
      "end_ms": 161975,
      "text": "搬来了三万五千多箱的仪器和图书和六千多名师生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00079",
      "start_ms": 162290,
      "end_ms": 163290,
      "text": "合肥没有暖气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00080",
      "start_ms": 163430,
      "end_ms": 166525,
      "text": "却为北方来的师生们铺设了全市第一条供暖线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00081",
      "start_ms": 167130,
      "end_ms": 168370,
      "text": "合肥最穷的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00082",
      "start_ms": 168450,
      "end_ms": 169670,
      "text": "市政府可以停电，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00083",
      "start_ms": 169690,
      "end_ms": 171325,
      "text": "但中科大绝不能停电。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00084",
      "start_ms": 171690,
      "end_ms": 174365,
      "text": "全城所有的粮食优先给到中科大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00085",
      "start_ms": 174780,
      "end_ms": 176260,
      "text": "每人每天省下一口粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00086",
      "start_ms": 176360,
      "end_ms": 178585,
      "text": "也一定要让中科大的师生吃饱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00087",
      "start_ms": 178870,
      "end_ms": 180890,
      "text": "在那个物质极度匮乏的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00088",
      "start_ms": 180890,
      "end_ms": 182650,
      "text": "一座又小又穷的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00089",
      "start_ms": 182770,
      "end_ms": 183730,
      "text": "倾其所有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00090",
      "start_ms": 183810,
      "end_ms": 186075,
      "text": "把一所流浪的大学揽入怀中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00091",
      "start_ms": 186480,
      "end_ms": 188805,
      "text": "这是一座城市对于知识最大的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00092",
      "start_ms": 189560,
      "end_ms": 190760,
      "text": "半个多世纪过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00093",
      "start_ms": 190760,
      "end_ms": 194500,
      "text": "这颗当年被合肥小心翼翼种下的种子生根开花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00094",
      "start_ms": 194700,
      "end_ms": 196840,
      "text": "成为合肥发展最坚实的人才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00095",
      "start_ms": 196840,
      "end_ms": 200255,
      "text": "底座千生一愿是百人一结清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00096",
      "start_ms": 200690,
      "end_ms": 201390,
      "text": "号称AI,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00097",
      "start_ms": 201390,
      "end_ms": 204405,
      "text": "黄埔军校撑起了人工智能国内的半边天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00098",
      "start_ms": 204910,
      "end_ms": 206390,
      "text": "清华北大出天才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00099",
      "start_ms": 206450,
      "end_ms": 207915,
      "text": "而中科大出神仙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00100",
      "start_ms": 208630,
      "end_ms": 212150,
      "text": "火星探测天问一号深海探测东风导弹的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00101",
      "start_ms": 212230,
      "end_ms": 213475,
      "text": "都有柯大人的影子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00102",
      "start_ms": 213960,
      "end_ms": 216315,
      "text": "哪个丈母娘不希望找一个中科大的女婿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00103",
      "start_ms": 216610,
      "end_ms": 218690,
      "text": "一个国家如果没有自己的存储芯片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00104",
      "start_ms": 218890,
      "end_ms": 221575,
      "text": "就是把数字时代的饭碗端在别人手里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00105",
      "start_ms": 221800,
      "end_ms": 224295,
      "text": "而长兴更给了全中国人以底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00106",
      "start_ms": 224760,
      "end_ms": 225660,
      "text": "如果没有安徽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00107",
      "start_ms": 225720,
      "end_ms": 227240,
      "text": "就没有江浙沪的繁华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00108",
      "start_ms": 227320,
      "end_ms": 229630,
      "text": "没有国泰民安的守护你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00109",
      "start_ms": 229630,
      "end_ms": 232085,
      "text": "知道为什么安徽总是感觉很穷吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00110",
      "start_ms": 232370,
      "end_ms": 235555,
      "text": "是因为安徽的抗日要比其他省份提前了几十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00111",
      "start_ms": 235900,
      "end_ms": 237945,
      "text": "中国抗日战争从九一八开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00112",
      "start_ms": 238240,
      "end_ms": 240975,
      "text": "而安徽人的抗日从甲午战争就开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00113",
      "start_ms": 241410,
      "end_ms": 242895,
      "text": "一八九四年甲午海战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00114",
      "start_ms": 243110,
      "end_ms": 245545,
      "text": "李鸿章的淮军撑起了北洋水师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00115",
      "start_ms": 245880,
      "end_ms": 246680,
      "text": "舰上的兵将，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00116",
      "start_ms": 246700,
      "end_ms": 248225,
      "text": "几乎全是江淮子弟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00117",
      "start_ms": 248640,
      "end_ms": 249740,
      "text": "安徽人一省战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00118",
      "start_ms": 249740,
      "end_ms": 251720,
      "text": "一国与日寇展开殊死搏斗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00119",
      "start_ms": 251720,
      "end_ms": 252915,
      "text": "最终全部牺牲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00120",
      "start_ms": 253260,
      "end_ms": 253960,
      "text": "抗战期间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00121",
      "start_ms": 254120,
      "end_ms": 255140,
      "text": "安徽打没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00122",
      "start_ms": 255140,
      "end_ms": 258880,
      "text": "整整一代人打到十室九空打到山穷水尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00123",
      "start_ms": 258980,
      "end_ms": 261475,
      "text": "最终无奈组建了中国第一支孤儿军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00124",
      "start_ms": 262010,
      "end_ms": 263670,
      "text": "全国二点九万个历史陵园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00125",
      "start_ms": 263670,
      "end_ms": 265045,
      "text": "安徽就占了二点二万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00126",
      "start_ms": 265670,
      "end_ms": 266990,
      "text": "安徽之所以吃米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00127",
      "start_ms": 266990,
      "end_ms": 267570,
      "text": "也吃面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00128",
      "start_ms": 267630,
      "end_ms": 268470,
      "text": "十里不同音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00129",
      "start_ms": 268470,
      "end_ms": 269355,
      "text": "百里不同俗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00130",
      "start_ms": 269610,
      "end_ms": 272285,
      "text": "就是因为安徽人后来汇聚了五湖四海的兄弟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00131",
      "start_ms": 272490,
      "end_ms": 273785,
      "text": "组成现在的安徽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00132",
      "start_ms": 274410,
      "end_ms": 276630,
      "text": "如今的安徽又承担着泄洪使命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00133",
      "start_ms": 276710,
      "end_ms": 278945,
      "text": "是全国泄洪区最多的省份。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00134",
      "start_ms": 279280,
      "end_ms": 280695,
      "text": "二零二一年的河南大水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00135",
      "start_ms": 280950,
      "end_ms": 281270,
      "text": "郑州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00136",
      "start_ms": 281270,
      "end_ms": 283735,
      "text": "一小时的降水量相当于一百五十个西湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00137",
      "start_ms": 284220,
      "end_ms": 286555,
      "text": "这洪水从郑州退去以后去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00138",
      "start_ms": 286740,
      "end_ms": 287855,
      "text": "大部分到了安徽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00139",
      "start_ms": 288190,
      "end_ms": 291015,
      "text": "当时安徽自己有将近四百万人受灾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00140",
      "start_ms": 291280,
      "end_ms": 292680,
      "text": "但是为了上保河南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00141",
      "start_ms": 292700,
      "end_ms": 293760,
      "text": "下保江浙沪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00142",
      "start_ms": 293940,
      "end_ms": 295965,
      "text": "安徽默默捂着自己的伤口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00143",
      "start_ms": 296290,
      "end_ms": 300510,
      "text": "开闸泄洪王家坝的村民放弃了自己辛苦建起来的房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00144",
      "start_ms": 300630,
      "end_ms": 302310,
      "text": "放弃了种满粮食的土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00145",
      "start_ms": 302490,
      "end_ms": 303450,
      "text": "连夜转移。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00146",
      "start_ms": 303590,
      "end_ms": 304510,
      "text": "而这样的牺牲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00147",
      "start_ms": 304630,
      "end_ms": 306550,
      "text": "安徽建国以来做了十多次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00148",
      "start_ms": 306790,
      "end_ms": 308230,
      "text": "舍小家为大家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00149",
      "start_ms": 308410,
      "end_ms": 310330,
      "text": "为饱城市自毁家乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00150",
      "start_ms": 310450,
      "end_ms": 315530,
      "text": "是安徽人扛下了所有滚滚逝去的洪水里藏着安徽人的泪水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00151",
      "start_ms": 315870,
      "end_ms": 316650,
      "text": "总有人调侃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00152",
      "start_ms": 316650,
      "end_ms": 317330,
      "text": "安徽很穷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00153",
      "start_ms": 317490,
      "end_ms": 318510,
      "text": "遍地是乞丐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00154",
      "start_ms": 318750,
      "end_ms": 319110,
      "text": "可是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00155",
      "start_ms": 319110,
      "end_ms": 319470,
      "text": "诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00156",
      "start_ms": 319710,
      "end_ms": 321430,
      "text": "中国四大商帮之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00157",
      "start_ms": 321430,
      "end_ms": 323550,
      "text": "鼎鼎有名的徽商怎么会穷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00158",
      "start_ms": 323930,
      "end_ms": 327000,
      "text": "不过是把满腔热血献给了最爱的祖国？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00159",
      "start_ms": 327420,
      "end_ms": 328360,
      "text": "安徽人委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00160",
      "start_ms": 328500,
      "end_ms": 330760,
      "text": "但安徽人从来不说中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00161",
      "start_ms": 330760,
      "end_ms": 336740,
      "text": "第一台蒸汽机、第一台卫星计算机、第一台电冰箱、第一艘电动船都在安徽诞生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00162",
      "start_ms": 337020,
      "end_ms": 339560,
      "text": "安徽省高铁总里程全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00163",
      "start_ms": 339720,
      "end_ms": 341900,
      "text": "汽车整车出口量全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00164",
      "start_ms": 341940,
      "end_ms": 344040,
      "text": "液晶显示屏产量全国第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00165",
      "start_ms": 344260,
      "end_ms": 347520,
      "text": "冰箱、空调、洗衣机产量都是全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00166",
      "start_ms": 347640,
      "end_ms": 351100,
      "text": "而量子科技专利更是全球前二全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00167",
      "start_ms": 351460,
      "end_ms": 354580,
      "text": "全球百分之十的笔记本电脑都是安徽生产。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00168",
      "start_ms": 355080,
      "end_ms": 356055,
      "text": "更让人感动的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00169",
      "start_ms": 356410,
      "end_ms": 357850,
      "text": "好不容易富起来的合肥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00170",
      "start_ms": 357990,
      "end_ms": 359475,
      "text": "也从来不吃独食，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00171",
      "start_ms": 359800,
      "end_ms": 361485,
      "text": "从不忘给兄弟们分一杯羹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00172",
      "start_ms": 361860,
      "end_ms": 362520,
      "text": "它做新能源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00173",
      "start_ms": 362520,
      "end_ms": 365300,
      "text": "整车芜湖搞传统车升级安庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00174",
      "start_ms": 365360,
      "end_ms": 367260,
      "text": "做车灯、六安做储能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00175",
      "start_ms": 367440,
      "end_ms": 370325,
      "text": "宣城负责上游原材料马鞍山做电池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00176",
      "start_ms": 370650,
      "end_ms": 372815,
      "text": "安徽十六个地市全部上出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00177",
      "start_ms": 373060,
      "end_ms": 373835,
      "text": "没有一个掉队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00178",
      "start_ms": 374210,
      "end_ms": 376750,
      "text": "诸晶合肥模式不能被简化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00179",
      "start_ms": 376750,
      "end_ms": 378895,
      "text": "成地方政府都去压龙头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00180",
      "start_ms": 379110,
      "end_ms": 384635,
      "text": "他背后是有中科大科学岛国家科学中心工程教育与既有制造业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00181",
      "start_ms": 384970,
      "end_ms": 387715,
      "text": "也有专业国资平台和跨任期的连续性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00182",
      "start_ms": 388190,
      "end_ms": 390325,
      "text": "如果没有技术判断和产业配套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00183",
      "start_ms": 390530,
      "end_ms": 393665,
      "text": "只学大手笔投钱复制出来的可能不是合肥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00184",
      "start_ms": 393880,
      "end_ms": 394505,
      "text": "而是债务。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00185",
      "start_ms": 395190,
      "end_ms": 396905,
      "text": "你看看合肥官方怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00186",
      "start_ms": 397230,
      "end_ms": 398150,
      "text": "我们不是风投，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00187",
      "start_ms": 398330,
      "end_ms": 399090,
      "text": "是铲投，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00188",
      "start_ms": 399330,
      "end_ms": 400175,
      "text": "不是赌博，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00189",
      "start_ms": 400430,
      "end_ms": 401085,
      "text": "是拼搏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00190",
      "start_ms": 401460,
      "end_ms": 402460,
      "text": "更让人敬佩的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00191",
      "start_ms": 402520,
      "end_ms": 405610,
      "text": "合肥国资的胸怀与格局掏了几百亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00192",
      "start_ms": 405710,
      "end_ms": 407035,
      "text": "却是投而不控，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00193",
      "start_ms": 407500,
      "end_ms": 408420,
      "text": "不抢控制权，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00194",
      "start_ms": 408460,
      "end_ms": 409395,
      "text": "不插手经营，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00195",
      "start_ms": 409600,
      "end_ms": 410765,
      "text": "不往董事会塞人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00196",
      "start_ms": 411060,
      "end_ms": 413540,
      "text": "这才是对专业主义精神的最大的尊重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00197",
      "start_ms": 413780,
      "end_ms": 417105,
      "text": "这也就是为什么没有任何城市能够复制合肥模式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00198",
      "start_ms": 417420,
      "end_ms": 420845,
      "text": "合肥真正押中的第一张王牌并不是某家公司，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00199",
      "start_ms": 421120,
      "end_ms": 421745,
      "text": "而是知识。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00200",
      "start_ms": 422170,
      "end_ms": 424905,
      "text": "他还为阅读这种慢事留下了空间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00201",
      "start_ms": 425270,
      "end_ms": 430775,
      "text": "合肥被称为高阅读城市密集的建设城市阅读空间和十五分钟的阅读圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00202",
      "start_ms": 431150,
      "end_ms": 433615,
      "text": "一间公共书房并不能直接制造GDP,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00203",
      "start_ms": 433890,
      "end_ms": 435095,
      "text": "但他会告诉年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00204",
      "start_ms": 435390,
      "end_ms": 439280,
      "text": "这座城市愿意为一个人安静坐下来的时间买单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00205",
      "start_ms": 439480,
      "end_ms": 442245,
      "text": "而这也是合肥模式最容易被人忽视的细节。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00206",
      "start_ms": 442610,
      "end_ms": 444510,
      "text": "网上喜欢说他出手果断，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00207",
      "start_ms": 444670,
      "end_ms": 446925,
      "text": "却很少说他为何判断得出。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00208",
      "start_ms": 447320,
      "end_ms": 448480,
      "text": "喜欢说他敢砸钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00209",
      "start_ms": 448700,
      "end_ms": 455570,
      "text": "却很少说知识、科研、工程、教育和产业调查才是钱不至于变成烟花的底层结构。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00210",
      "start_ms": 455750,
      "end_ms": 458365,
      "text": "合肥是真正靠读书改变命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00211",
      "start_ms": 458850,
      "end_ms": 460120,
      "text": "朱军这世上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00212",
      "start_ms": 460120,
      "end_ms": 462315,
      "text": "哪有什么点石成金的风头神话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00213",
      "start_ms": 462700,
      "end_ms": 463940,
      "text": "长兴上市的钟声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00214",
      "start_ms": 464100,
      "end_ms": 466535,
      "text": "不过是时间给合肥的一封回信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00215",
      "start_ms": 466900,
      "end_ms": 468040,
      "text": "那是五十六年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00216",
      "start_ms": 468060,
      "end_ms": 473275,
      "text": "合肥用砸锅卖铁的制成为军学者保留下来了一张温暖的书桌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00217",
      "start_ms": 473580,
      "end_ms": 474280,
      "text": "那是厂房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00218",
      "start_ms": 474280,
      "end_ms": 475745,
      "text": "机器二十四小时运转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00219",
      "start_ms": 476010,
      "end_ms": 478730,
      "text": "一群穿着无尘服的人看不见风景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00220",
      "start_ms": 478830,
      "end_ms": 479990,
      "text": "却在制造未来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00221",
      "start_ms": 480350,
      "end_ms": 481370,
      "text": "五十六年之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00222",
      "start_ms": 481550,
      "end_ms": 483770,
      "text": "对知识的后代和技术的尊重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00223",
      "start_ms": 484030,
      "end_ms": 485310,
      "text": "反哺了这座城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00224",
      "start_ms": 485770,
      "end_ms": 488130,
      "text": "而你以为这就是合肥的极限了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00225",
      "start_ms": 488350,
      "end_ms": 491530,
      "text": "合肥的手里还握着一张震撼世界的终极王牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00226",
      "start_ms": 491830,
      "end_ms": 493030,
      "text": "可控核聚变。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00227",
      "start_ms": 493390,
      "end_ms": 495430,
      "text": "从东方超环屡破世界纪录，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00228",
      "start_ms": 495490,
      "end_ms": 497350,
      "text": "到跨府大科学装置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00229",
      "start_ms": 497370,
      "end_ms": 498370,
      "text": "破译核心部件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00230",
      "start_ms": 498610,
      "end_ms": 500570,
      "text": "再到人造太阳装置冲刺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00231",
      "start_ms": 500650,
      "end_ms": 502910,
      "text": "点亮人类第一盏聚变之灯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00232",
      "start_ms": 503330,
      "end_ms": 506360,
      "text": "全国百分之三十七的核聚变专利都在合肥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00233",
      "start_ms": 506620,
      "end_ms": 509520,
      "text": "这里正在孕育属于全人类的能源未来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00234",
      "start_ms": 509920,
      "end_ms": 511980,
      "text": "从当年毫无优势的中部城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00235",
      "start_ms": 512040,
      "end_ms": 514960,
      "text": "到如今一战封神的直逼全国第四城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00236",
      "start_ms": 515240,
      "end_ms": 518440,
      "text": "合肥不追风口、不赚快钱、不炒概念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00237",
      "start_ms": 518740,
      "end_ms": 519880,
      "text": "所年如一日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00238",
      "start_ms": 520020,
      "end_ms": 521080,
      "text": "倾一城之力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00239",
      "start_ms": 521200,
      "end_ms": 523820,
      "text": "托举属于中国的科技巨头企业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00240",
      "start_ms": 523820,
      "end_ms": 527300,
      "text": "在熬城市也在熬熬过了周期低谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00241",
      "start_ms": 527400,
      "end_ms": 528560,
      "text": "熬过了技术封锁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00242",
      "start_ms": 528740,
      "end_ms": 531060,
      "text": "终于迎来了万物复苏的收获期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00243",
      "start_ms": 531380,
      "end_ms": 534920,
      "text": "所有的爆发都是折伏后的必然为合肥骄傲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00244",
      "start_ms": 534920,
      "end_ms": 536875,
      "text": "为中国硬科技点赞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00245",
      "start_ms": 537440,
      "end_ms": 538760,
      "text": "回望合肥这座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00246",
      "start_ms": 538780,
      "end_ms": 541685,
      "text": "你会发现他几乎一直在做合这件事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00247",
      "start_ms": 541980,
      "end_ms": 544085,
      "text": "它让长江与淮河相合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00248",
      "start_ms": 544430,
      "end_ms": 547235,
      "text": "让北方的刚劲与南方的细腻相合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00249",
      "start_ms": 547560,
      "end_ms": 550205,
      "text": "让古老的泸州与现代科创相合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00250",
      "start_ms": 550460,
      "end_ms": 553105,
      "text": "让一座大学与一座城相合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00251",
      "start_ms": 553750,
      "end_ms": 554490,
      "text": "三国时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00252",
      "start_ms": 554650,
      "end_ms": 557070,
      "text": "合肥守住的是曹魏东南的一道门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00253",
      "start_ms": 557250,
      "end_ms": 561265,
      "text": "而今天他打开的是中国硬科创未来的一扇门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00254",
      "start_ms": 561670,
      "end_ms": 564565,
      "text": "所以驻军合肥到底肥在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00255",
      "start_ms": 565090,
      "end_ms": 566770,
      "text": "他不是肥在天生富足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00256",
      "start_ms": 566770,
      "end_ms": 567890,
      "text": "而是肥在胆识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00257",
      "start_ms": 567910,
      "end_ms": 568765,
      "text": "肥在耐心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00258",
      "start_ms": 569010,
      "end_ms": 570725,
      "text": "一座城市最伟大的逆袭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00259",
      "start_ms": 570970,
      "end_ms": 572165,
      "text": "不是终于被人看见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00260",
      "start_ms": 572510,
      "end_ms": 574290,
      "text": "而是他当年在无人看见时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00261",
      "start_ms": 574290,
      "end_ms": 577265,
      "text": "仍然愿意把钱、时间和信任交给明天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00262",
      "start_ms": 577680,
      "end_ms": 579180,
      "text": "这座城市从来不信风口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00263",
      "start_ms": 579340,
      "end_ms": 580355,
      "text": "它只信一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00264",
      "start_ms": 580720,
      "end_ms": 582400,
      "text": "把种子埋进土里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00265",
      "start_ms": 582440,
      "end_ms": 583340,
      "text": "浇十年水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00266",
      "start_ms": 583460,
      "end_ms": 584640,
      "text": "等它自己长出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fcb57a01fcf6046_s00267",
      "start_ms": 584760,
      "end_ms": 587015,
      "text": "而这才是真正的合肥。"
    }
  ],
